Subject: [PATCH v6 02/12] drm/xe: Allow prefetch-only VM bind IOCTLs to use VM
 read lock
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 18:09:37 -0700
Message-Id: <20260724010947.1573757-3-matthew.brost@intel.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.34.1
In-Reply-To: <20260724010947.1573757-1-matthew.brost@intel.com>
